            <ArticleTitle>Application of Doppler technology to studies of the coronary circulation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>33-43</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Presently available Doppler technology has allowed us to substantially increase our understanding of the regulation of the coronary circulation in humans. New technologic developments in this area promise to further enhance our understanding of the operational characteristics of the coronary circulation in patients in normal and pathologic states.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
